# Records the README demo GIF: `vhs assets/demo.tape` (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Type "npx rote-cli stats"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s

Type "npx rote-cli learn 1"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
